<h2 class="text-secondary">Registry &amp; Nomenclature Working Group</h2><hr/>
<% id = modal('Functions of Registry & Nomenclature Working Group',
              size: :lg) do %>
  <ol>
    <li>To maintain and develop the functionality of the SeqCode
      Registry.</li>
    <li>To provide the nomenclatural expertise needed for curation of the
      SeqCode Registry.</li>
    <li>To provide the nomenclatural advice for those needing assistance in
      forming Latin names for novel taxa.</li>
  </ol>
<% end %>
<p class="lead">
  The SeqCode Registry has been established to record and maintain names that
  are formed or recognized under the SeqCode (<%= link_to_rule('4') %>).
  <%= modal_button(id, class: 'text-primary') do %>
    Functions of the Registry &amp; Nomenclature Working Group
  <% end %>.
</p>
